    "detailed_description": "Embark on a fast-paced action journey through space, discovering new weapons and abilities through acquisition and research to better each run. Invite friends to experience it with you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be careful how you order your items</h2>Each time you are hit, and item will drop from your ship. When you have no items left, you are only one hit away from critical hull breach!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883970/extras/3a6579c7d7e5f440e1a9e62e22f66c4e.poster.avif?t=1751471215\" width=764 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883970/extras/3a6579c7d7e5f440e1a9e62e22f66c4e.webm?t=1751471215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883970/extras/3a6579c7d7e5f440e1a9e62e22f66c4e.mp4?t=1751471215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beam into derelict ships to use unique abilities to combat unique enemies!</h2>Take the ship back to base to research the new technology for later runs<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check out the mothership bar between missions, in first person view!</h2>Fully interactable level between missions to talk to characters about research, combat and story events<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death in co-op does not leave you out of the fun!</h2>When you die in multiplayer coop, you will be attached to a player who is still alive, but you will be missing your items.<br>When the player you are in picks them up, you can shoot from the alive player's ship!",
